      "sourceValidated": true,
      "runtimeReproducedByReviewer": false,
      "observation": "NativeApplicationsScreen.hasSavedOpportunities tests model.jobs plus earlier career.savedJobs. Saved and its badge use model.savedOpportunities, which also adds retained meaningful records without bookmarks. A record-only guest therefore gets Search jobs and the Search destination despite existing entries in Saved.",
