      "acceptedBy": "/root",
      "fixOwner": "/root/recovery_review",
      "proposedFix": "Use model.savedOpportunities plus career.savedJobs for the guest manual-route decision.",
      "successorVerified": true,
      "fixCommit": "927b7c49f5cd5722e5d8fbdb8e5b5b4a11173101",
      "verifiedAtUTC": "2026-11-18T12:50:05.127987+00:00",
      "successorVerification": "Predicate now uses model.savedOpportunities plus career.savedJobs. Existing iPhone private-record journey adds bookmark removal, Open saved jobs route, retained note and no-bookmark-restoration assertions."
    },
    {
      "id": "android-copy-failure-and-confirmation",
      "status": "fixed_source_verified",
      "severity": "conditional resilience and feedback gap",
      "sourceValidated": true,
      "runtimeReproducedByReviewer": false,
      "observation": "The click callback calls ClipboardManager.setPrimaryClip without failure handling, then reports Copied when the manager is non-null. That is not a proof that the expected item was installed.",
      "apiEvidence": "The AOSP client setter returns void and rethrows RemoteException as a runtime exception. The Android 16 service returns without writing when clipboardAccessAllowed for OP_WRITE_CLIPBOARD is false. These support conditional exceptional-failure and silently-denied-write paths; they do not prove normal copying fails on the current device.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": "/Users/saleh/Developer/career-finder-improvement-20261118-ebb3eed5/android/app/src/main/java/com/saleh/careerfinder/MainActivity.kt",
          "symbol": "ProfileContactReuse copy callback"
        }
      ],
      "primarySourceKeys": [
        "aosp-clipboard-manager",
        "aosp-android16-clipboard-service"
      ],
      "acceptedBy": "/root",
      "fixOwner": "/root/recovery_review",
      "proposedFix": "Handle exceptions and confirm a fresh per-copy opaque marker using primaryClipDescription metadata only before showing Copied. Missing or mismatched metadata should remain unconfirmed with visible fallback; preserve the chosen field and draft. Product code should not read clipboard text or log/store marker contents.",
      "proposalReviewed": true,
      "proposalDisposition": "Narrow approach is consistent with the privacy boundary; actual successor source remains to be inspected.",
      "successorVerified": true,
      "fixCommit": "927b7c49f5cd5722e5d8fbdb8e5b5b4a11173101",
      "verifiedAtUTC": "2026-11-18T12:50:05.127987+00:00",
      "successorVerification": "copyContactField creates a fresh UUID, writes only the chosen field with sensitive flag and operation marker, and confirms only its marker through primaryClipDescription. Stale/missing descriptions and write/read exceptions return false. UI success is conditional; localized failure leaves the profile values intact. No product clipboard-text reads, marker logging, persistence or network operation found in the reviewed patch."
    }
  ],
